I found 10 issues in PR 45 (`dev/analyze-input-fixes`). The first six are correctness bugs and the rest are cleanup. I didn't run the tests or the DB queries, and I didn't verify the findings, as this review mode asks. Finding 2 in particular is a plausible case I haven't reproduced.

