    "failure_scenario": "url='https://bsky.app/profile/bot.bsky.social/feed/news' or '/lists/abc': bsky=(bot.bsky.social, None), the author is added to handles, and clusters_for_handle returns cluster #2. The response is status='matched' with clusters=[#2]. A post link by the same author that isn't in a cluster would only get author_clusters as context, so the less specific link gets the stronger answer."
